{"v":2,"lessons":[{"id":"it:c0","title":"@c_pron","level":"@beginner","kind":"grammar","intro":"Pronunciation is relatively easy in Italian since most words are pronounced exactly how they are written. The main letters to watch out for are c and g, since their pronunciation varies based on the following vowel. Also, make sure to pronounce r and rr differently: caro means dear, whereas carro means chariot.","sections":[{"heading":"Vowels","body":"a : as in \"father\" · e : sometimes as in \"set\", sometimes more closed, identical to \"e\" in New Zealand English · i : as in \"machine\" · o : as in \"oh\", but make sure to avoid any \"w\" or \"oo\" sound at the end · u : like 'oo' in \"hoop\""},{"heading":"Consonants","body":"b : like 'b' in \"bed\" · c : like 'ch' in \"chipper\" when before 'i' or 'e', like 'k' in \"skin\" otherwise · d : like 'd' in \"dog\" · f : like 'f' in \"fear\" · g : like 'g' in \"go\" (before 'a', 'o', 'u')like 'j' in \"jello\" (before 'i' or 'e') · h : silent · j : generally only appears in proper nouns (e.g. Juventus). Pronounced like 'y' in \"yet\". · l : like 'l' in \"love\" · m : like 'm' in \"mother\" · n : like 'n' in \"nice\" · p : like 'p' in \"spray\" · q : like 'q' in \"quest\" (always with \"u\" except in some Arabic loanwords) · r : trill with the tip of the tongue just as in Spanish. A double r (rr) requires a stronger trill. · s : like 's' in \"gas\", like 'z' in \"lizard\" when between vowels only in the North of Italy. · t : like 't' in \"stop\" · v : like 'v' in \"victory\" · z : like 'ds' in \"toads\" or like 'ts' in \"coats\""},{"heading":"Common diphthongs","body":"ai : like 'i' in \"fight\" · au : like 'ow' in \"brown\" · ei : like 'ay' in \"say\" · eu : like hey you · ee : identical vowels [stress on the first vowel \"idee\" (ee-DEH-eh)] · ia : like see ya, but with the 'a' as in \"father\" · ie : similar to \"yeah\" · ii : identical vowels [stress on the first vowel \"addii\" (ahd-DEE-ee)] · io : \"EE-oh\" like the 'eo' in \"Leo\" · iu : like 'ew' in \"few\" · oi : like 'oy' in \"boy\" · oo : identical vowels [stress on the first vowel \"zoo\" (DZOH-oh)] · ua : like 'wa' in \"want\" · ue : like 'we' in \"went\" · ui : like \"we\" · uo : like \"woe\""}],"phrases":[]},{"id":"it:c2","title":"@c_first","level":"@beginner","intro":"@c_intro","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"APERTO","f":"OPEN","r":"ah-PEHR-toh"},{"t":"CHIUSO","f":"CLOSED","r":"KYOO-soh"},{"t":"ENTRATA","f":"ENTRANCE","r":"ehn-TRAH-tah"},{"t":"USCITA","f":"EXIT","r":"oo-SHEE-tah"},{"t":"SPINGERE","f":"PUSH","r":"SPEEN-jeh-reh"},{"t":"TIRARE","f":"PULL","r":"tee-RAH-reh"},{"t":"TOILETTE / WC","f":"TOILET","r":"twah-LEHT"},{"t":"UOMINI","f":"MEN","r":"WOH-mee-nee"},{"t":"DONNE","f":"WOMEN","r":"DOHN-neh"},{"t":"PROIBITO / VIETATO","f":"FORBIDDEN","r":"proy-BEE-toh"},{"t":"NON FUMATORI / VIETATO FUMARE}}","f":"NO SMOKING","r":"nohn foo-mah-TOH-ree"},{"t":"Salve.","f":"Hello. (formal)","r":"SAHL-veh"},{"t":"Ciao.","f":"Hello. (informal)","r":"chow"},{"t":"Come stai?, Come sta?","f":"How are you?","r":"informal"},{"t":"Bene, grazie.","f":"Fine, thank you.","r":"BEH-neh, GRAHT-tsyeh"},{"t":"Come ti chiami?, Come si chiama?","f":"What is your name?","r":"informal"},{"t":"Mi chiamo ______ .","f":"My name is ______ .","r":"mee kee-AH-moh _____"},{"t":"Piacere di conoscerla.; Piacere di conoscerti or just Ciao, piacere","f":"Nice to meet you.","r":"formal"},{"t":"Per favore or Per piacere","f":"Please.","r":"PEHR fah-VOH-reh"},{"t":"Grazie.","f":"Thank you.","r":"GRAHT-tsyeh"},{"t":"Prego.","f":"You're welcome.","r":"PREH-goh"},{"t":"Non c'è problema or Nessun problema","f":"No problem.","r":"non cheh proh-BLEH-mah'', ''neh-SOON proh-BLEM-mah"},{"t":"Sì.","f":"Yes","r":"SEE"},{"t":"No.","f":"No","r":"noh"},{"t":"Mi scusi., Scusa","f":"Excuse me","r":"formal"},{"t":"Che cos'è?","f":"What's that?","r":"KAY kohz-AY"},{"t":"Mi dispiace.","f":"I'm sorry.","r":"mee dee-SPYA-chee"},{"t":"Arrivederci.","f":"Goodbye. (formal)","r":"ahr-ree-veh-DEHR-chee"},{"t":"Ci vediamo.","f":"See you.","r":"chee veh-DYAH-moh"},{"t":"Certamente, or Certo","f":"Sure.","r":"cher-tah-MEN-teh'' or ''CHEHR-toh"},{"t":"Davvero?","f":"Really?","r":"dahv-VEH-roh?"},{"t":"Non parlo italiano.","f":"I don't speak Italian.","r":"non PAHR-loh ee-tah-LYAH-noh"},{"t":"Parla inglese? Parli inglese?","f":"Do you speak English?","r":"Formal"},{"t":"Parli più lentamente, per favore., Parla più lentamente/piano.)","f":"Speak more slowly, please.","r":"formal"},{"t":"Capisco l’italiano solo un po'.","f":"I understand Italian a little.","r":"kah-PEES-koh lee-tah-LYAH-noh SOH-loh oon poh"},{"t":"Conosco solo poche parole in italiano.","f":"I speak just a few words of Italian.","r":"koh-NOHS-koh SOH-loh POH-keh pah-ROH-leh een ee-tah-LYAH-noh"},{"t":"Qualcuno qui parla inglese?","f":"Is there someone here who speaks English?","r":"kwahl-KOO-noh PAHR-lah een-GLEH-zeh?"},{"t":"Cosa significa? or Cosa vuol dire?","f":"What does it mean?","r":"KOH-zah see-NYEE-fee-kah?, KOH-zah vwohl DEE-reh?"},{"t":"Ho dimenticato.","f":"I forgot.","r":"oh dee-mehn-tee-KAH-toh"},{"t":"Ora ricordo.","f":"Now I remember.","r":"OH-rah ree-KOHR-doh"},{"t":"Non lo so.","f":"I don’t know.","r":"nohn loh soh"},{"t":"Dopo","f":"After","r":"DOH-poh"},{"t":"Prima","f":"Before","r":"PREE-mah"},{"t":"Aspetti!, Aspetta!","f":"Wait!","r":"formal"},{"t":"Ho una domanda.","f":"I have a question.","r":"oh OO-nah doh-MAHN-dah"},{"t":"Può dirmi..., Puoi dirmi...","f":"Can you tell me...","r":"formal"},{"t":"Come arrivo a...","f":"How to get to...","r":"KOH-meh ahr-REE-voh ah"},{"t":"Dove/Quando ci incontriamo?","f":"Where/When do we meet?","r":"DOH-veh/ KWAHN-doh chee een-kohn-TRYAH-moh?"},{"t":"Che tempo fa?","f":"How is the weather?","r":"keh TEHM-poh fah"},{"t":"Mentre","f":"While","r":"MEHN-treh"},{"t":"Così","f":"So","r":"koh-ZEE"},{"t":"Perché","f":"Why/Because","r":"pehr-KEH"},{"t":"Come?","f":"Pardon?","r":"KOH-meh?"},{"t":"Aiuto!","f":"Help!","r":"ah-YOO-toh!"},{"t":"Buon giorno.","f":"Good morning.","r":"bwohn JOHR-noh"},{"t":"Buon pomeriggio.","f":"Good afternoon.","r":"bwohn poh-meh-REE-joh"},{"t":"Buona sera.","f":"Good evening.","r":"bwoh-nah SEH-rah"},{"t":"Buona notte.","f":"Good night.","r":"bwoh-nah NOHT-teh"},{"t":"Non capisco.","f":"I don't understand.","r":"nohn kah-PEES-koh"},{"t":"Dov'è un bagno?","f":"Where are the restrooms? (public place)","r":"doh-VEH oon BAHN-yoh"},{"t":"Dov'è il bagno?","f":"Where is the bathroom? (someone's home)","r":"doh-VEH eel BAHN-yoh"}]},{"id":"it:c3","title":"@c_numbers","level":"@beginner","intro":"Unlike English, Italian uses the long scale, so un bilione and un trilione are not the same as the English \"one billion\" and \"one trillion\".","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"zero","f":"0","r":""},{"t":"uno","f":"1","r":"OO-noh"},{"t":"due","f":"2","r":"DOO-eh"},{"t":"tre","f":"3","r":"treh"},{"t":"quattro","f":"4","r":"KWAH-troh"},{"t":"cinque","f":"5","r":"CHEEN-kweh"},{"t":"sei","f":"6","r":"SEH-ee"},{"t":"sette","f":"7","r":"SEH-teh"},{"t":"otto","f":"8","r":"OH-toh"},{"t":"nove","f":"9","r":"NOH-veh"},{"t":"dieci","f":"10","r":"DYEH-chee"},{"t":"undici","f":"11","r":"OON-dee-chee"},{"t":"dodici","f":"12","r":"DOH-dee-chee"},{"t":"tredici","f":"13","r":"TREH-dee-chee"},{"t":"quattordici","f":"14","r":"kwahr-TOHR-dee-chee"},{"t":"quindici","f":"15","r":"KWEEN-dee-chee"},{"t":"sedici","f":"16","r":"SEH-dee-chee"},{"t":"diciassette","f":"17","r":"dee-chah-SSEH-teh"},{"t":"diciotto","f":"18","r":"dee-CHOH-toh"},{"t":"diciannove","f":"19","r":"dee-chah-NOH-veh"},{"t":"venti","f":"20","r":"VEHN-tee"},{"t":"ventuno","f":"21","r":"vehn-TOO-noh"},{"t":"ventidue","f":"22","r":"vehn-tee-DOO-eh"},{"t":"ventitré","f":"23","r":"vehn-tee-TREH"},{"t":"trenta","f":"30","r":"TREHN-tah"},{"t":"quaranta","f":"40","r":"kwah-RAHN-tah"},{"t":"cinquanta","f":"50","r":"cheen-KWAHN-tah"},{"t":"sessanta","f":"60","r":"sehs-SAHN-tah"},{"t":"settanta","f":"70","r":"seht-TAHN-tah"},{"t":"ottanta","f":"80","r":"oht-TAHN-tah"},{"t":"novanta","f":"90","r":"noh-VAHN-tah"},{"t":"cento","f":"100","r":"CHEHN-toh"},{"t":"duecento","f":"200","r":"dweh-CHEHN-toh"},{"t":"trecento","f":"300","r":"treh-CHEHN-toh"},{"t":"mille","f":"1,000","r":"MEEL-leh"},{"t":"duemila","f":"2,000","r":"dweh-MEE-lah"},{"t":"un milione","f":"1,000,000","r":"oon mee-LYOH-neh"},{"t":"un miliardo","f":"1,000,000,000","r":"oo mee-LYAHR-doh"},{"t":"un bilione","f":"1,000,000,000,000","r":"oo bee-LYOH-neh"},{"t":"numero_____","f":"number _____ (train, bus, etc.)","r":"NOO-meh-roh"},{"t":"mezzo","f":"half","r":"MEHD-dzoh"},{"t":"meno","f":"less","r":"MEH-noh"},{"t":"più","f":"more","r":"pyoo"}]},{"id":"it:c4","title":"@c_time","level":"@beginner","intro":"; one o'clock AM : l'una or l'una del mattino (LOO-nah) \n; two o'clock AM : le due or le due del mattino (leh DOO-eh)\n; noon : mezzogiorno (mehd-dzoh-JOHR-noh)\n; one o'clock PM : le tredici or l'una del pomeriggio (leh TREH-dee-chee)\n; two o'clock PM : le quattordici or le due del pomeriggio (leh kwaht-TOHR-dee-chee)\n; midnight : mezzanotte (mehd-dzah-NOHT-teh)","sections":[{"heading":"@c_remember","body":"; January : gennaio (jehn-NAH-yoh)\n; February : febbraio (fehb-BRAH-yoh)\n; March : marzo (MAR-tso)\n; April : aprile (ah-PREE-leh)\n; May : maggio (MAHD-joh)\n; June : giugno (JOO-nyoh)\n; July : luglio (LOO-lyoh)\n; August : agosto (ah-GOHS-toh)\n; September : settembre (seht-TEM-breh)\n; October : ottobre (oht-TOH-breh)\n; November : novembre (noh-VEHM-breh)\n; December : dicembre (dee-CHEM-breh)"},{"heading":"@c_remember","body":"First in dates is the day, then is the month, and last is the year."},{"heading":"@c_remember","body":"For example: 23/1/2010 is in letters 23 gennaio 2010."}],"phrases":[{"t":"adesso / ora","f":"now","r":"ah-DEHSS-oh"},{"t":"più tardi - dopo","f":"later","r":"PYOO TAR-dee"},{"t":"prima","f":"before","r":"PREE-ma"},{"t":"mattino / mattina","f":"morning","r":"mah-TEEN-oh"},{"t":"pomeriggio","f":"afternoon","r":"poh-meh-REEJ-joh"},{"t":"sera","f":"evening","r":"SEH-rah"},{"t":"notte","f":"night","r":"NOHT-teh"},{"t":"l'una or l'una del mattino","f":"one o'clock AM","r":"LOO-nah"},{"t":"le due or le due del mattino","f":"two o'clock AM","r":"leh DOO-eh"},{"t":"mezzogiorno","f":"noon","r":"mehd-dzoh-JOHR-noh"},{"t":"le tredici or l'una del pomeriggio","f":"one o'clock PM","r":"leh TREH-dee-chee"},{"t":"le quattordici or le due del pomeriggio","f":"two o'clock PM","r":"leh kwaht-TOHR-dee-chee"},{"t":"mezzanotte","f":"midnight","r":"mehd-dzah-NOHT-teh"},{"t":"_____ minuto/ti","f":"_____ minute(s)","r":"mee-NOO-toh/tee"},{"t":"_____ ora/e","f":"_____ hour(s)","r":"OH-rah/eh"},{"t":"_____ giorno/ni","f":"_____ day(s)","r":"JOHR-noh/nee"},{"t":"_____ settimana/ne","f":"_____ week(s)","r":"seht-tee-MAH-nah/neh"},{"t":"_____ mese/si","f":"_____ month(s)","r":"MEH-zeh/zee"},{"t":"_____ anno/ni","f":"_____ year(s)","r":"AHN-noh/nee"},{"t":"oggi","f":"today","r":"OHJ-jee"},{"t":"ieri","f":"yesterday","r":"YEH-ree"},{"t":"domani","f":"tomorrow","r":"doh-MAH-nee"},{"t":"dopo domani","f":"day after tomorrow","r":"doh-poh doh-MAH-nee"},{"t":"questa settimana","f":"this week","r":"KWEHS-tah seht-tee-MAH-nah"},{"t":"la settimana scorsa","f":"last week","r":"lah set-tee-MAH-nah SKOR-sah"},{"t":"la prossima settimana","f":"next week","r":"lah PROHS-see-mah set-tee-MAH-nah"},{"t":"domenica","f":"Sunday","r":"doh-MEH-nee-kah"},{"t":"lunedì","f":"Monday","r":"loo-neh-DEE"},{"t":"martedì","f":"Tuesday","r":"mahr-teh-DEE"},{"t":"mercoledì","f":"Wednesday","r":"mehr-koh-leh-DEE"},{"t":"giovedì","f":"Thursday","r":"joh-veh-DEE"},{"t":"venerdì","f":"Friday","r":"veh-nehr-DEE"},{"t":"sabato","f":"Saturday","r":"SAH-bah-toh"},{"t":"gennaio","f":"January","r":"jehn-NAH-yoh"},{"t":"febbraio","f":"February","r":"fehb-BRAH-yoh"},{"t":"marzo","f":"March","r":"MAR-tso"},{"t":"aprile","f":"April","r":"ah-PREE-leh"},{"t":"maggio","f":"May","r":"MAHD-joh"},{"t":"giugno","f":"June","r":"JOO-nyoh"},{"t":"luglio","f":"July","r":"LOO-lyoh"},{"t":"agosto","f":"August","r":"ah-GOHS-toh"},{"t":"settembre","f":"September","r":"seht-TEM-breh"},{"t":"ottobre","f":"October","r":"oht-TOH-breh"},{"t":"novembre","f":"November","r":"noh-VEHM-breh"},{"t":"dicembre","f":"December","r":"dee-CHEM-breh"}]},{"id":"it:c5","title":"@c_colours","level":"@beginner","intro":"@c_intro","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"nero","f":"black","r":"NEH-roh"},{"t":"bianco","f":"white","r":"BYAHN-koh"},{"t":"grigio","f":"gray","r":"GREE-joh"},{"t":"rosso","f":"red","r":"ROHS-soh"},{"t":"blu / azzurro","f":"blue","r":"bloo"},{"t":"giallo","f":"yellow","r":"JAHL-loh"},{"t":"verde","f":"green","r":"VEHR-deh"},{"t":"arancione","f":"orange","r":"ah-rahn-CHOH-neh"},{"t":"viola","f":"purple","r":"vee-OH-lah"},{"t":"marrone","f":"brown","r":"mahr-ROH-neh"},{"t":"rosa","f":"pink","r":"ROH-sah"}]},{"id":"it:c6","title":"@c_problems","level":"@elementary","intro":"@c_intro","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"Mi lasci in pace. / Lasciami in pace.","f":"Leave me alone.","r":"mee LAH-shee een PAH-cheh"},{"t":"Non mi toccare!","f":"Don't touch me!","r":"NOHN mee toh-KAH-reh!"},{"t":"Chiamo la polizia.","f":"I'll call the police.","r":"KYAH-moh lah poh-lee-TSEE-ah!"},{"t":"Aiutami!","f":"Help me!","r":""},{"t":"Polizia!","f":"Police!","r":"poh-lee-TSEE-ah!"},{"t":"Al ladro!","f":"Stop! Thief!","r":"ahl LAH-droh!"},{"t":"Al fuoco!","f":"Fire!","r":"ahl FWOH-koh!"},{"t":"Ho bisogno del tuo aiuto.","f":"I need your help.","r":"oh bee-ZOH-nyoh dehl too-oh ah-YOO-toh"},{"t":"È un'emergenza.","f":"It's an emergency.","r":"eh oo-neh-mehr-JEN-tsah"},{"t":"Mi sono perso / Mi sono persa.","f":"I'm lost.","r":"male"},{"t":"Ho perso la mia borsa.","f":"I lost my bag.","r":"oh PEHR-soh lah MEE-ah BOHR-sah"},{"t":"Ho perso il mio portafoglio.","f":"I lost my wallet.","r":"oh PEHR-soh eel myoh pohr-tah-FOH-lyoh"},{"t":"Sono malato. / Sono malata","f":"I'm sick.","r":"male"},{"t":"Sono ferito / Sono ferita","f":"I've been injured.","r":"male"},{"t":"Ho bisogno di un dottore.","f":"I need a doctor.","r":"oh bee-ZOH-nyoh dee oon dot-TOH-reh"},{"t":"Posso usare il suo telefono? / Posso usare il tuo telefono?","f":"Can I use your phone?","r":"formal"}]},{"id":"it:c7","title":"@c_transport","level":"@elementary","intro":"; Taxi! : Taxi! (TAHK-see)\n; Take me to _____, please. : Mi porti a _____, per favore. (mee POHR-tee ah..., pehr fah-VOH-reh)\n; How much does it cost to get to _____? : Quanto costa andare a _____? (KWAHN-toh KOHS-tah ahn-DAH-reh ah...?)\n; Please take me to_____. : Per favore, mi porti a______. (pehr fah-VOH-reh, mee POHR-tee ah...)\n; I'm in a hurry! : Vado di fretta! / Ho fretta! (VAH-doh dee FREHT-tah/ oh FREHT-tah)\n; Stop here, please! : Fermi qui, per favore! (FEHR-mee kwee pehr fah-VOH-reh)\n; How much do I owe you? : Quanto le devo? (formal) (KWAHN-toh leh DEH-voh)","sections":[],"phrases":[{"t":"Taxi!","f":"Taxi!","r":"TAHK-see"},{"t":"Mi porti a _____, per favore.","f":"Take me to _____, please.","r":"mee POHR-tee ah..., pehr fah-VOH-reh"},{"t":"Quanto costa andare a _____?","f":"How much does it cost to get to _____?","r":"KWAHN-toh KOHS-tah ahn-DAH-reh ah...?"},{"t":"Per favore, mi porti a______.","f":"Please take me to_____.","r":"pehr fah-VOH-reh, mee POHR-tee ah..."},{"t":"Vado di fretta! / Ho fretta!","f":"I'm in a hurry!","r":"VAH-doh dee FREHT-tah/ oh FREHT-tah"},{"t":"Fermi qui, per favore!","f":"Stop here, please!","r":"FEHR-mee kwee pehr fah-VOH-reh"},{"t":"Quanto le devo?","f":"How much do I owe you?","r":"KWAHN-toh leh DEH-voh"},{"t":"treno","f":"Train","r":"TREH-noh"},{"t":"autobus or pullman","f":"Bus","r":"OW-toh-boos"},{"t":"Quanto costa un biglietto per _____?","f":"How much is a ticket to _____?","r":"KWAHN-toh KOHS-tah oon bee-LYEHT-toh pehr"},{"t":"Un biglietto per _____, per favore.","f":"One ticket to _____, please.","r":"oon bee-LYEHT-toh pehr....pehr fah-VOH-reh"},{"t":"Dove va questo treno/autobus/pullman?","f":"Where does this train/bus go?","r":"DOH-veh vah KWEHS-toh TR